{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a custom Shopify section based on the visual layout provided. Ensure the accordion style and text content match exactly as shown in the reference image.
    
    ⚠️ Do not change or rewrite any text.
    ⚠️ Do not alter the structure or order of the FAQ items.
    
    The section should contain:
    
    1. Section Structure
    
    Full-width section
    
    Background: white
    
    Centered content
    
    Max content width: 1100px to 1200px
    
    Padding: 64px top/bottom for desktop, 40px top/bottom for mobile
    
    2. Title
    
    Text: “Strategic FAQ”
    
    Font size: 32px–36px (desktop), 24px–28px (mobile)
    
    Font weight: bold
    
    Text color: dark blue (similar to #003366)
    
    Text alignment: center
    
    Margin-bottom: 40px
    
    3. Accordion Layout
    
    Use an accordion-style layout with expandable/collapsible sections for each FAQ
    
    Each accordion item should have:
    
    A question (clickable, expands the answer)
    
    A short description (answer to the question, hidden until expanded)
    
    Accordion style:
    
    Background: white with a light gray border
    
    When expanded, change background to a light blue with white text
    
    Active item should have a bold heading and expanded answer visible
    
    Font size for FAQ title: 16px–18px
    
    Font size for FAQ answer: 14px–16px
    
    Text color for FAQ question: dark blue
    
    Text color for FAQ answer: dark gray
    
    4. FAQ Items
    
    Each FAQ item should contain the following questions and answers:
    
    FAQ 1:
    Question: “What’s the difference vs a regular grocery store probiotic?”
    Answer: “Generic probiotics often contain poorly studied strains at low dosages. Our formula combines L. reuteri DSM 17648 and L. gasseri at 150B CFU—that’s 7-15x more concentrated than average.”
    
